Meet Steve Wilbury: magician, entertainer, and the customer who has broken more bones than anyone we know.

Steve's job is to make things disappear. Unfortunately, his luck seems to go with them. {ONE-LINE INJURY STORY FROM BLOG}

Here's what he told us:
"Really helps me move when sometimes I can't."

We love Steve's story, and his sense of humour about it. Read the whole thing on our blog: {BLOG LINK}

Got an unlucky streak of your own? Tell us in the comments. Kindest words only.
